WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.880
I've been at FF21 for the last three months,

00:02.880 --> 00:06.060
and those three months were very easy for me.

00:06.080 --> 00:09.680
Just going to office, coming back. No food tension,

00:09.960 --> 00:11.040
nothing, no laundry tension.

00:11.180 --> 00:13.560
Everything has been handled by FF21.

00:14.100 --> 00:18.720
And it's not a very big amount they charge for all of this.

00:18.860 --> 00:21.240
Even the swing has been provided by FF21.

00:21.820 --> 00:23.180
There are a lot of amenities.

00:23.260 --> 00:25.460
As you can see, there's a pool table.

00:25.900 --> 00:29.340
There's a table tennis table, which I used to play after office.

00:29.340 --> 00:33.740
So I can enjoy my personal life as well as my professional life

00:33.740 --> 00:35.980
without any hassle.
